{
  "name": "02 Scan morning 08:00 ET",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "08:00 ET Mon-Fri",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "app_settings.scanner_schedule.morning_scan. SIP pre-market bars are ~15 min delayed, so the scan sees volume through ≈07:45 ET (decision #10)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/scan/run",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "kind",
              "value": "morning"
            },
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 600000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "POST /scan/run?kind=morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Every scannable strategy's screener params + entry conditions from strategy_configs → scans. Phase 3 (enrich) and Phase 4 (Hermes plans) chain after this node. Engine sends the Telegram summary."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/enrich/run",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 900000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "POST /enrich/run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Phase 3: top 5 passed candidates per strategy (app_settings.sentiment) -> Finnhub + Yahoo RSS -> local hermes3:8b condenser -> news_sentiment, and a catalyst block onto today's scans rows. Never flips scans.passed and never clears a gate (decisions 21, 22). Engine sends its own Telegram summary. ~60-90 s for a full morning; timeout 15 min."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/signals/plan",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "notify",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 900000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "POST /signals/plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Phase 4: template 04 in-play gate -> template 02 trade plans -> `signals`, plus the S2 watchlist briefing (template 03) -> `briefings`. Hosted Hermes 70B via OpenRouter, ~1c a morning. Plans are PROPOSALS: every price is re-validated in code and a failing plan is stored rejected with its reason. Nothing is executed here — approval is Phase 5."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://engine:8000/execute/push-signals",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "POST /execute/push-signals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TradeHub Engine token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Phase 5: pushes today's proposed signals to Telegram as cards with Deploy / Cancel buttons. Tapping Deploy runs workflow 04, which re-checks the kill switch and the full Guardian gate before any order is placed. Nothing is automatic."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "08:00 ET Mon-Fri": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /scan/run?kind=morning",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST /scan/run?kind=morning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /enrich/run",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST /enrich/run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /signals/plan",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST /signals/plan": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /execute/push-signals",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/New_York",
    "errorWorkflow": ""
  },
  "active": false,
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "phase-2"
    },
    {
      "name": "phase-3"
    },
    {
      "name": "phase-4"
    },
    {
      "name": "phase-5"
    }
  ]
}
